first_planning.user_prompt_template:
Task goal
{task_goal}

Applicable keyframe policy object copied from task config
{keyframe_policy}

Saved keyframe evidence; null before capture
{saved_keyframe}

Current observations with candidate observation IDs
{current_observations}

Use task goal together with saved_keyframe when it exists, or with a current observation selected as keyframe_save in this call, as the necessary sources for concrete subgoal planning. Return the currently knowable subgoal_sequence prefix and repeat its first entry as next_subgoal_key, next_subgoal, and arguments. Apply keyframe_policy.save_when to the supplied observations and return the exact matching observation ID as keyframe_save, or null. Do not guess highlighted cube identities, perform verification, output action_name, or invent an observation ID. Output JSON only.

